                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opi Yehova ’yo ’dini: Eri ma fu dri emi dri ci, emi opi Israeli ma drilia ’diyi la! Emi nze egana pi afa opaza be, emi ’ye e’yo liza pi e’yo liza kililiruri be; emi ku ’ba mani ma afa opazu okposi ja, Opi Yehova ’yo ra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
